<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="412902495"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1114415161"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Still Falls The Rain"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="AOA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Good Luck"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:16.979"><div begin="00:12.253" end="03:04.445"><p begin="00:12.253" end="00:16.932" itunes:key="L1">어느새 어둠이 내려오고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉夜幕降临</span></p><p begin="00:17.564" end="00:22.135" itunes:key="L2">하늘에선 비가 내리고 있죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空飘起了雨</span></p><p begin="00:22.648" end="00:27.643" itunes:key="L3">어깨에 젖어가는 빗물처럼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像打湿肩膀的雨水般</span></p><p begin="00:27.978" end="00:32.985" itunes:key="L4">두 눈에도 하염없이 흐르죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双眼也茫然地流着泪</span></p><p begin="00:33.087" end="00:38.353" itunes:key="L5">I'll never ever miss you, I'll never ever love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不会想你</span></p><p begin="00:38.404" end="00:43.754" itunes:key="L6">다짐해도 습관처럼 니가 그리울 때면<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下了决心也如习惯一般</span></p><p begin="00:43.827" end="00:48.726" itunes:key="L7">마치 독한 감기처럼 끝이 없는 장마처럼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像患上重感冒一般</span></p><p begin="00:48.770" end="00:53.454" itunes:key="L8">니 생각에 헤어 나올 수 없어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法摆脱对你的思念</span></p><p begin="00:53.237" end="00:59.322" itunes:key="L9">비가 오는 날에 오늘 같은 밤엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下雨的日子里</span></p><p begin="00:59.577" end="01:03.791" itunes:key="L10">널 그리다 울다 잠들죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思念着你流着泪入睡</span></p><p begin="01:03.811" end="01:09.780" itunes:key="L11">비가 내린 후에 슬퍼 지는 밤엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨后</span></p><p begin="01:09.966" end="01:14.937" itunes:key="L12">널 부르다 혼자 아프죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼唤着你 独自忧伤</span></p><p begin="01:14.978" end="01:18.142" itunes:key="L13">다신 Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次</span></p><p begin="01:18.207" end="01:20.053" itunes:key="L14">Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢 噢 噢 噢 噢</span></p><p begin="01:20.101" end="01:22.546" itunes:key="L15">Never fall in love again, love again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">决意不再坠入情网</span></p><p begin="01:22.752" end="01:25.251" itunes:key="L16">바보처럼 널 못 잊어도<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">傻瓜一样无法将你遗忘</span></p><p begin="01:25.446" end="01:28.414" itunes:key="L17">다신 Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次</span></p><p begin="01:28.615" end="01:30.396" itunes:key="L18">Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢 噢 噢 噢 噢</span></p><p begin="01:30.397" end="01:32.960" itunes:key="L19">Never gonna love again, love again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">决意不再坠入情网</span></p><p begin="01:33.082" end="01:38.008" itunes:key="L20">눈물 속에 너를 지워도 Still falls the rain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在眼泪中将你抹掉</span></p><p begin="01:38.113" end="01:41.113" itunes:key="L21">Hey 기억은 나 우리 처음 만났던 날<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得</span></p><p begin="01:41.138" end="01:43.725" itunes:key="L22">꼭 그날 처럼 비가 내리는 밤<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像那日般下着雨的夜里</span></p><p begin="01:43.745" end="01:46.689" itunes:key="L23">니 흔적이 가득한 내 방구석에 널 닮은 곰<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我房间角落里都是你的痕迹</span></p><p begin="01:46.733" end="01:49.650" itunes:key="L24">인형만 아직 옆에 남아 널 추억하게 해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在身边只剩与你相似的熊玩偶</span></p><p begin="01:49.793" end="01:52.170" itunes:key="L25">우리 사랑한 날에 같이 듣던 노래<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们相爱的日子里一起听过的歌曲</span></p><p begin="01:52.291" end="01:54.701" itunes:key="L26">너와 내가 함께 즐겨 부르던 노래<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和我</span></p><p begin="01:54.773" end="01:57.329" itunes:key="L27">더 크게 노래 틀고 흐르는 니 목소리<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢唱过的歌曲</span></p><p begin="01:57.366" end="02:00.165" itunes:key="L28">곁에 있는 것만 같아 날 떠나가지 말아<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">流淌出的你的声音</span></p><p begin="01:59.361" end="02:04.469" itunes:key="L29">I'll never ever miss you , I'll never ever love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要离开我</span></p><p begin="02:04.524" end="02:09.541" itunes:key="L30">불러봐도 괜찮다가 문득 외로울 때면<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声呼唤也没关系</span></p><p begin="02:09.595" end="02:14.810" itunes:key="L31">마치 내 그림자처럼 끝이 없는 미로처럼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像我的影子一般</span></p><p begin="02:14.959" end="02:19.759" itunes:key="L32">하루 종일 빠져 나올 수 없어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整日沉迷</span></p><p begin="02:19.397" end="02:25.333" itunes:key="L33">비가 오는 날에 오늘 같은 밤엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下雨的日子里</span></p><p begin="02:25.704" end="02:29.909" itunes:key="L34">널 그리다 울다 잠들죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思念着你流着泪入睡</span></p><p begin="02:29.957" end="02:35.728" itunes:key="L35">비가 내린 후에 슬퍼지는 밤엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨后</span></p><p begin="02:36.145" end="02:41.046" itunes:key="L36">널 부르다 혼자 아프죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼唤着你 独自忧伤</span></p><p begin="02:40.923" end="02:44.057" itunes:key="L37">다신 Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次</span></p><p begin="02:44.224" end="02:46.037" itunes:key="L38">Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢 噢 噢 噢 噢</span></p><p begin="02:46.238" end="02:48.584" itunes:key="L39">Never fall in love again, love again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">决意不再坠入情网</span></p><p begin="02:48.777" end="02:51.464" itunes:key="L40">바보처럼 널 못 잊어도<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">傻瓜一样无法将你遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:51.530" end="02:54.604" itunes:key="L41">다신 Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次</span></p><p begin="02:54.686" end="02:56.479" itunes:key="L42">Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢 噢 噢 噢 噢</span></p><p begin="02:56.592" end="02:59.097" itunes:key="L43">Never gonna love again, love again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">决意不再坠入情网</span></p><p begin="02:59.252" end="03:04.445" itunes:key="L44">눈물 속에 너를 지워도 Still falls the rain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在眼泪中将你抹掉</span></p></div></body></tt>